# Brand assets that more than one repository carries a copy of.
#
# Each row is: <sha256>  <path in the repo being checked>  <home>
#
# The home is where the file is maintained; every other copy is a distribution
# artefact and must be byte-identical to it. The `shared-files` job in the
# hygiene gate checks each row whose path exists in the repo it is checking, and
# skips rows whose home repository is the one being checked (GOV-R12).
#
# GitHub renders a README from the repository it lives in, so a repo that shows
# the mark in its README needs the file in its own tree. The copies cannot be
# removed; this file is what keeps them honest.
#
# `logo.svg` and `logo-on-ink.svg` are the horizontal lockup under the names the
# READMEs reach for. Renaming them in every README would be churn for no gain,
# so the home is recorded here instead.

694ec10889edce57e2e8b7fc6248d2d6a4aca032adfaad785974b6c12ce722fb  .github/logo.svg                       brand:assets/logo/lockup-horizontal.svg
b1d5ef3c2db6fbcf74c71544cffe89065b6b7ddfb81eee82f50826d983042259  .github/logo-on-ink.svg                brand:assets/logo/lockup-horizontal-on-ink.svg
49644a8c94f0d413a7bff5b2252701362b111086926f41835013ad904a9174c1  .github/discord.svg                    .github:.github/discord.svg
c1092d6b7340c2b63cd075a1cb3465fcb94b795ac99a51a93368c71b93def56c  .github/nightworks-dark.png            .github:.github/nightworks-dark.png
e27b53ced4cb69dd3f9ae3d9510cfc78d174fd2f5fd5dd3ed315acb445286b6c  .github/nightworks-white.png           .github:.github/nightworks-white.png

# The site serves the same marks from its own tree, because a built page cannot
# reach into another repository at request time.

694ec10889edce57e2e8b7fc6248d2d6a4aca032adfaad785974b6c12ce722fb  public/brand/lockup-horizontal.svg     brand:assets/logo/lockup-horizontal.svg
694ec10889edce57e2e8b7fc6248d2d6a4aca032adfaad785974b6c12ce722fb  public/brand/logo.svg                  brand:assets/logo/lockup-horizontal.svg
b1d5ef3c2db6fbcf74c71544cffe89065b6b7ddfb81eee82f50826d983042259  public/brand/logo-on-ink.svg           brand:assets/logo/lockup-horizontal-on-ink.svg
450aa4d489e512bd2dd937a59080a7a2f615a164ac4fc0bb51c027f6f7160173  public/brand/lockup-horizontal-knockout.svg  brand:assets/logo/lockup-horizontal-knockout.svg
2f5692a931e5c9f1d67d1752eaff8eb2456dde80e5ddb4a2e4b1d31547ab742b  public/brand/mark-small.svg            brand:assets/logo/mark-small.svg
2f5692a931e5c9f1d67d1752eaff8eb2456dde80e5ddb4a2e4b1d31547ab742b  public/favicon.svg                     brand:assets/logo/mark-small.svg
b757049f07c0c2ff2c0594b81c4b9891bb4f701da15f8b86baeab26b0679db7a  public/brand/wordmark.svg              brand:assets/logo/wordmark.svg
80d91a5a9b08e868c553da7ef57ed9a0dbc7d8ca741ae3f84f018e90dc2dc671  public/brand/wordmark-mono.svg         brand:assets/logo/wordmark-mono.svg
49644a8c94f0d413a7bff5b2252701362b111086926f41835013ad904a9174c1  public/brand/discord.svg               .github:.github/discord.svg
c1092d6b7340c2b63cd075a1cb3465fcb94b795ac99a51a93368c71b93def56c  public/brand/nightworks-dark.png       .github:.github/nightworks-dark.png
e27b53ced4cb69dd3f9ae3d9510cfc78d174fd2f5fd5dd3ed315acb445286b6c  public/brand/nightworks-white.png      .github:.github/nightworks-white.png

# The companion asserts two brand colours in PHP, because a module may not read
# a file and a provider may not read one at boot. Its own suite checks those two
# against this copy of the brand's token file; this row is what keeps the copy
# equal to the brand's own, so the two checks in series mean the application
# paints what the brand says and not what somebody typed.

2ae3b4c9f74199860786a2796700061f2e293214b4875f90329f2622fa861fae  app-modules/design/resources/tokens.json  brand:tokens/tokens.json

# The accessibility page measures the palette rather than quoting it, so the
# spec needs the palette in its own tree: a generator cannot reach another
# repository, and the three ratios that went wrong here went wrong precisely
# because nothing local could be checked against.

2ae3b4c9f74199860786a2796700061f2e293214b4875f90329f2622fa861fae  60-brand/tokens.json  brand:tokens/tokens.json
